# LANDFALL: every planet is built by the same rules (the community's
# generation rules for the original): a 7 x 4 or 6 x 5 grid with four to
# six cells of solid stone, exactly four real gates on the outer edge
# (a chart piece, the dungeon, a tool, two of the rare resource), gated
# side rooms never side by side, six or seven villages, six trades priced
# by rarity, eight tools (five lying about, one gated, two sold), four
# energy cells (now and then five), one hidden wall, a six-room dungeon,
# two friendly and four hostile species (one of them dropping chops), and
# every planet winnable. The audit checks all of it on 400 planets.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat planet 1
expect audit == 0
expect winnable == 1
expect gw == 7
expect gh == 4
expect gate_role0 >= 0
expect gate_role1 >= 0
expect gate_role2 >= 0
expect gate_role3 >= 0
expect villages == 6
expect ncubes == 4
# five tools lying about plus the gated one, four cells, two chart pieces
# (the third is sold), two bundles (the rare gate's 2, the hidden wall's 4)
expect things1 == 6
expect things2 == 4
expect things3 == 2
expect things4 == 2
# this planet's rarity: ferns common, burrs less, beads more, spores rare
expect tier_of2 == 0
expect tier_of1 == 1
expect tier_of0 == 2
expect tier_of3 == 3
# the pods, thumper and chop press each burn a different one, never ferns
expect cost3 == 0
expect cost4 == 1
expect cost6 == 3
expect cost0 == 255
expect cost5 == 255
# prices by rarity: the chart piece 32 of the less uncommon one; the tools
# 4 of the rare one and 32 of the common one
expect trade3_kind == 2
expect trade3_pay == 1
expect trade3_payn == 32
expect trade0_kind == 1
expect trade0_pay == 3
expect trade0_payn == 4
expect trade1_kind == 1
expect trade1_pay == 2
expect trade1_payn == 32
# resource trades: 16 >> tier paid, 32 >> tier given
expect trade4_kind == 0
expect trade4_payn == 2
expect trade4_getn == 32
expect trade5_payn == 8
expect trade5_getn == 4
# three of the six trades speak in glyphs
expect trade0_glyph == 1
expect trade1_glyph == 1
expect trade2_glyph == 1
expect trade3_glyph == 0
expect trade4_glyph == 0
expect trade5_glyph == 0
# the species: two friendly (one in glyphs), four hostile; three of those
# drop the three plain resources, one drops chops; the locals drop the rare
expect sp0_friendly == 1
expect sp0_glyph == 0
expect sp1_friendly == 1
expect sp1_glyph == 1
expect sp1_drop == 3
expect sp2_friendly == 0
expect sp2_drop == -1
expect sp3_drop == 2
expect sp4_drop == 1
expect sp5_drop == 0
# the big shell: 3 to touch
expect sp6_dmg == 3
# 400 planets: every rule holds on every one
expect audit_many_1_200_0 == 0
expect audit_many_1000_200_0 == 0
# both grid shapes, seven villages about two times in five, a fifth cell
# now and then, and the generator seldom needs a second try
expect audit_many_1_200_1 >= 70
expect audit_many_1_200_1 <= 130
expect audit_many_1_200_2 >= 50
expect audit_many_1_200_2 <= 110
expect audit_many_1_200_3 >= 5
expect audit_many_1_200_3 <= 45
expect audit_many_1_200_5 <= 20
# (the queries leave this planet as it was)
expect gw == 7
expect seed == 1
